    "details": "<p><strong>PARANOVA '26 &mdash; Hackathon</strong></p>\n<p>PARANOVA '26 is an 8-hour coding and innovation challenge where teams build solutions to real-world problems aligned with the UN Sustainable Development Goals.</p>\n<p><strong>Quick Info:</strong></p>\n<p>Team size: 2&ndash;4 members (inter-college allowed)<br />Registration: Free</p>\n<p>Deadline: 14th September, 2026<br />Shortlist announced: 15th September<br />Final Hackathon: 17th September, Offline at College of Engineering, Kidangoor, Kottayam</p>\n<p>Hackathon will be completely offline. All members are to be reported in-person at the venue on 17th September, 2026.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Register</strong><br />All registrations and abstract submissions are done through our official website:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>https://paradox.ce-kgr.org/hackathon</strong></p>\n<p>Registering on Unstop alone does not count , so please complete registration on the website.</p>\n<p><strong>For further details, visit our website.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Contact:</strong></p>\n<p>Anna Rose Dolfy : +91 8304959545</p>\n<p>Sreenandan: +91 9567528609</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
